# GoDaddy's parking page was the whole content of altorien.com for years, and
# it is one line of JavaScript: window.location.href = "/lander". Any browser
# that ever loaded the domain still has that HTML on disk, so it fires before
# the network is consulted, jumps to /lander, and gets a 404 with an empty
# body -- a blank screen on a site that is working perfectly.
#
# Cache-clearing fixes it for one person. This fixes it for everyone who ever
# opened the parked domain, including anyone the links get sent to.
/lander    /    301
/lander/*  /    301
